{
  "title": "Yellowed Flaky Greek Spinach Spanakopita",
  "description": "A fermented, flaky, light Greek dish featuring cocoa and spinach, made with render-fat for a lacto-vegetarian friendly meal. This spanakopita is perfect for a snack or light lunch.",
