  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees.",
    "Chop the onion and mince the garlic.",
    "Sauté the onion and garlic in render-fat until softened.",
    "Add the spinach and cook until wilted.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix the cocoa powder, feta cheese, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Combine the spinach mixture and cocoa mixture.",
    "Layer the filo dough in a baking dish, brushing with render-fat.",
    "Fill the filo dough with the spinach and cocoa mixture.",
    "Bake for 35 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
